    "chunk_text": "ine & \u00feu leofast. Se halga Margareta him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, eala, ge yfelan \u00feehteras, ganga\u00fe ge wif to eowrum husum & ge God me is fultumiende. For\u00feon nelle ic eow geheran, ne ic n\u00e6fre me ne gebidde on eowerne god, se \u00fee is dumb & deaf. Ac geleafa\u00fe on minne god, se \u00fee is strang on m\u00e6genne, & hr\u00e6dlice he gehyra\u00fe \u00fea \u00fee on hine gel\u00e6fa\u00fe. & heo cw\u00e6\u00fe \u00fea to \u00feam gerefan, eala, \u00feu unge\u00feunggena hund & \u00feu ungefylledlican dracan, mannes Se halga Margareta bes\u00e6h up to heofonum & cw\u00e6\u00f0, gestrangie me, lifes gast, \u00fe\u00e6t min gebed \u00feurh & gesend me \u00feinne \u00feone halgan gast fram heofonum, sy me cyme me to fultume \u00fe\u00e6t ic gehealde & \u00fe\u00e6t sy bysen & bl\u00e6d a eallum f\u00e6mnum \u00fee on \u00fee geleuat, for\u00feon \u00fein nama is gebletsod on \u00dea c\u00e6mpan \u00fea eodan & cwylmdon hire lichaman. \u00d0a bewrah se arleasa gerefa his ansyna mid his hacelan, for\u00feon \u00fee he ne mihte on hire locian for \u00fe\u00e6m Efne, \u00fein lichoma is gecwilmed for minum \u00feam egeslican dome. Ge\u00feafa me & gebide \u00fee on minne god, \u00fey l\u00e6s \u00feu dea\u00fee swiltast. Gif \u00feu me ne gehyrast, min sweord sceal wealdan \u00feines lichoman. Gif \u00feu me ne gehyr\u00e6st, \u00e6tforan eallum \u00feissum folce ic \u00fee to cwe\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fee onfo me to wife. Se halga Margareta him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, eala",
